Description: PAM module that automatically mounts a gocryptfs directory
 on login.
 .
 It mounts a per-user gocryptfs filesystem when the session opens, using the
 login password as the passphrase, and unmounts it when the last session of
 that user closes. Paths and mount options are configurable per user, so it
 can serve either a ~/Private subdirectory or a fully encrypted home
 directory. Inspired by pam_ecryptfs.
